Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CcAtO2dgxzG58x6sze8dlg","review_id":"O74uU9cGCCpWQop2pV1_JQ","date":"2018-12-27T00:32:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9602836966514587,"text_excerpt":"Seriously if the line at Cafe du Monde is insane just head a few blocks further down to the French Market and get some praline stuffed beignets from Loretta's! Honestly they were amazing and I would probably come here again over Cafe du Monde if I had a gun to my head. I'm not even the biggest fan of pralines on their own. They're a little too sweet for me but when it's melted into a piping hot beignet it's SO good and just enhances the beignet experience."},{"business_id":"CcAtO2dgxzG58x6sze8dlg","review_id":"TNTfapCHR6IuFYN5UDBq1Q","date":"2022-01-03T05:31:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9492499828338623,"text_excerpt":"In all honesty, I've never been impressed with beignets. I've done Cafe Du Monde and a few other coffee type shops, but they're not one of my favorite parts of New Orleans. Then one of the tour guides recommended Loretta's in the French Market, and said to get the praline beignets. I will never be able to visit the French Quarter without stopping there again. They are definitely to share, because they're very sweet and have a lot of powdered sugar, but emotionally you'll want them all for yourself because they're amazing. They're warm, gooey, wrapped in a doughy shell with the right amount of crunch. Her actual pralines are delicious too - not too sweet, and if you get them to go they can..."},{"business_id":"CcAtO2dgxzG58x6sze8dlg","review_id":"IX8m-TNxyCF_8JxBq53pfQ","date":"2021-04-28T17:59:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9478200674057007,"text_excerpt":"I'm so glad that I was able to make a stop at this place. I had learned about this place from a YouTube video I watched and was curious about their pralines, however, I ended walking away from this place falling in love with their beignets. I tried Cafe Beignet and Cafe Du Monde, and although both were good, this was took the crown for me. Their beignets were super flaky. It almost reminded of a croissant style beignet. I also ordered the praline filled beignet, but I'm already not a huge fan of fillings and custards, so it wasn't my fave - it does seem to be a crowd favorite though. Make this a stop when you visit NOLA on your beignet adventure!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CcAtO2dgxzG58x6sze8dlg","photo_id":"WpW0TCe-1g-pGV4uqWoATw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WpW0TCe-1g-pGV4uqWoATw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9358997941017151},{"business_id":"CcAtO2dgxzG58x6sze8dlg","photo_id":"m-JSGTIBf1qjOfnFlTB2Dw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/m-JSGTIBf1qjOfnFlTB2Dw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.907330334186554},{"business_id":"CcAtO2dgxzG58x6sze8dlg","photo_id":"ultAiquM5V4Jfs9bU7Omrw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ultAiquM5V4Jfs9bU7Omrw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8896442651748657},{"business_id":"CcAtO2dgxzG58x6sze8dlg","photo_id":"byP2idqBRLb7Mb3J9z3Q7A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/byP2idqBRLb7Mb3J9z3Q7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8416516184806824},{"business_id":"CcAtO2dgxzG58x6sze8dlg","photo_id":"BQLpoEHwy-iaPUpEwDZsmQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/BQLpoEHwy-iaPUpEwDZsmQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7995244264602661}]},"notebook_case":null}
